# Marketing-site analytics (this site ONLY — never the LOAM app). Set these in the Vercel project's
# Environment Variables so they're inlined into the build. With no key set (e.g. local dev), analytics
# is a complete no-op.
#
# Your PostHog project API key (starts with `phc_`).
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
#
# The ingest host is fixed to the EU region (https://eu.i.posthog.com) in code AND the site CSP
# (vercel.json `connect-src`), so it is not an env override — a mismatched host would be blocked by CSP.
# To use a different region, change both places together.
